19	/**
20	 * Control-panel WEBSITE_* handlers.
21	 *
22	 * Registered in worker/index.ts:
23	 *   WEBSITE_CREATE: websiteCreate,
24	 *   WEBSITE_DELETE: websiteDelete,
25	 *   WEBSITE_TOGGLE: websiteToggle,
26	 *   WEBSITE_SSL:    websiteSsl,
27	 *
28	 * Ownership + validation happen at enqueue time (lib/actions-websites.ts); these
29	 * trust `payload.websiteId` but STILL re-validate every value against the strict
30	 * allowlist in lib/ssh-exec before it can reach a shell.
31	 *
32	 * SANDBOX (staging): no SSH — statuses flip with synthetic success, exactly like
33	 * every other worker feature. On prod the real nginx/php/certbot work runs only
34	 * when ENABLE_REAL_CPANEL === "1" (belt-and-suspenders, mirroring worker/ssl.ts);
35	 * otherwise it also takes the simulated-success branch so a fresh prod box can't
36	 * be mutated until the operator explicitly enables it.
